        "content": "What a HILARIOUS and refreshing podcast! Incredible ! Cal I am sure it's not your style but it is so GREAT soooo great seeing someone pushing vehemently against AI. and actually has a good input. Waaaay to many people in tech avoided the elephant in the room. As a scientist myself, I really struggled with the dumbed down or moderate explanations about AI directions. So THANK you for taking that risk!",
